      "content": "the thing is i live pretty far from the hospital and it's kind of a drive. plus i'm feeling 100% normal right now so the thought of sitting in an ER for hours for something that already went away seems like overkill. you really think i need to go in right this second or is it okay to just sleep on it and see how i feel in the morning?",
