      "content": "yeah urgent care is also a bit of a trek. i guess if i just take some aspirin and stay relaxed tonight it might help prevent anything else from happening? i'm mostly just worried about it happening while i'm sleeping. is there anything i can do at home to just make sure i'm okay until morning?",
